  note = {Opened the complete primary author version. For the covariant polynomial argument we read section 5, equations (5.1)--(5.2), author pp. 12--13, the complete coefficient-basis proof of Lemma 5.1, p. 14, and the complete double-centralizer proof of Theorem 5.2, p. 15. These constructions work over any field of characteristic different from 2. We use them over the rationals and separately apply Maschke's theorem. Publication metadata and DOI verified on the arXiv record.}
